The icons in this directory come from two sets, both changed here and there
for the overlay. Every one is a filled shape on a 24x24 grid.

Remix Icon 4.5.0 (https://remixicon.com), Copyright (c) 2017 Remix Design,
Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE-remixicon): the files named after Remix Icon's
own (*-line, space). As published, but for these:

  battery-medium-line.svg    battery-low-line.svg, its charge bar to the middle
  battery-full-line.svg      battery-low-line.svg, its charge bar to the end
  volume-down-line.svg       moved 3 units left, its speaker where the other
                             volume icons have theirs
  signal-wifi-low-line.svg   signal-wifi-line.svg, its lower part filled
  signal-wifi-high-line.svg  signal-wifi-line.svg, most of it filled

Lucide (https://lucide.dev), Copyright (c) Lucide Icons and Contributors, ISC
license (LICENSE-lucide): book-open, coffee, disc-3, ethernet-port,
gamepad-2, keyboard, sun, trophy. Changed to match Remix Icon: their
strokes turned into shapes (outlines filled), with sharper corners (no
rounding of their own, only the stroke's width rounding the outer side,
flat line ends) and round dots; disc-3 redrawn as a filled disc with a wider
hole; coffee with its handle lower and its steam longer and wavy.
